DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18087::$$$message_0137_0000_0000$$$::"Hello! Good to see you!"[wm canskip=0][rf]::
18088::$$$message_0137_0001_0000$$$::"Buogh...!?"[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=走る感じ(下から) time=300][lr]::
18089::$$$message_0137_0001_0001$$$::I fall over from the shock.::
18090::$$$message_0137_0002_0000$$$::"Wh-wh-wh-who's there!?"::
18091::$$$message_0137_0003_0000$$$::"Not sure how to answer that. I have no name, you see. That's a real puzzler of a question, actually.[lr]::
18092::$$$message_0137_0003_0001$$$::Yeah, I know that I'm me, but I don't know who I am. What a dilemma.[lr]::
18093::$$$message_0137_0003_0002$$$::Mm, does that make me an unidentified entity?"::
18094::$$$message_0137_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18095::$$$message_0137_0004_0001$$$::...Oh, no.[lr]::
18096::$$$message_0137_0004_0002$$$::I think I've just warped into some ominous dimension.::
18097::$$$message_0137_0005_0000$$$::"Enough beating around the bush![lr]::
18098::$$$message_0137_0005_0001$$$::I'm the mercenary sergeant, here on orders to help you conquer Illya's Castle, that den of evil in this forest!"::
18099::$$$message_0137_0006_0000$$$::"And you're, um... Runner 46, Shirou Emiya from Fuyuki City, and Runner 99, Saber from faraway Britannia!"[cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧01a(中)][wvs][fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=-254 index=2000 top=71 time=100 storage=セイバー鎧01a(中)][lr]::
18100::$$$message_0137_0006_0001$$$::"Yes. Let us bring down that wicked castle today."::
18101::$$$message_0137_0007_0000$$$::"S-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]Saber!? When did you get here!?"::
18102::$$$message_0137_0008_0000$$$::"When? Why would you say that, Shirou? I heard from Illyasviel..."::
18103::$$$message_0137_0009_0000$$$::"Good evening! [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 color=0xffFFFFFF time=300 storage=イリヤ11a(中)]How's everyone doing? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ02a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 color=0xffFFFFFF time=300 storage=イリヤ02a(中)]Are you all getting along with Shirou while I'm gone? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ05a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 color=0xffFFFFFF time=300 storage=イリヤ05a(中)]Wait, you are? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ04a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 color=0xffFFFFFF time=300 storage=イリヤ04a(中)]Good, good[cacheimage storage=イリヤ01a(近),black][wvl canskip=0 time=500][clfg][fg index=1000 pos=c storage=イリヤ01a(近)][dash page=back textoff=0 mx=136 opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=120 imag=2 time=300 cy=488 mag=2 my=-1 rot=-0.0 accel=-2][fadein textoff=0 time=100 storage=black noclear=1][line len=3]You're dead meat.[lr]::
18104::$$$message_0137_0009_0001$$$::Anyway, I just finished building my new castle, so come play, okay? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 color=0xffFFFFFF time=300 storage=イリヤ11c(中)]Hehehe. Try and destroy it, if you can."::
18105::$$$message_0137_0010_0000$$$::"She sent such a polite invitation, don't you think?[lr]::
18106::$$$message_0137_0010_0001$$$::When I saw you headed to the forest, I realized it was finally time, and hastened to join the march."::
18107::$$$message_0137_0011_0000$$$::"I-I never heard about any invitation...![lr]::
18108::$$$message_0137_0011_0001$$$::For that matter, doesn't this person strike you as weird, Saber!?[wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-3]"::
18109::$$$message_0137_0012_0000$$$::"...Now that you mention it...her coloring is rather sweet. But Shirou, it isn't right to judge people based on appearance."[lr]::
18110::$$$message_0137_0012_0001$$$::"That's not the problem here. It's her acting that's the problem, not her coloring."::
18111::$$$message_0137_0013_0000$$$::"Shut up! Cut the chatter, recruits![lr]::
18112::$$$message_0137_0013_0001$$$::It's way too late for you to talk back to a supporting character, you bargain-bin protagonist!"::
18113::$$$message_0137_0014_0000$$$::"See, Shirou? She's upset because you're making idle conversation before a battle.[lr]::
18114::$$$message_0137_0014_0001$$$::A superior officer's orders are absolute on the battlefield. Your commander is God. She is Truth. Bury any thoughts of unfairness and discontent. A soldier's duty is to be a member of a fighting force.[lr]::
18115::$$$message_0137_0014_0002$$$::You still fail to comprehend this."::
18116::$$$message_0137_0015_0000$$$::"Well said, Saber! This is the run! With an uncontrollable weapon of mass destruction like Saber on our side, Illya's Castle is as good as papier-mâché![lr]::
18117::$$$message_0137_0015_0001$$$::Am I right, Saber!?"::
18118::$$$message_0137_0016_0000$$$::"Hehehe. You're eager to see blood tonight."::
18119::$$$message_0137_0017_0000$$$::"Smashing! This week, victory shall be ours![lr]::
18120::$$$message_0137_0017_0001$$$::Okay, is everyone ready?[lr]::
18121::$$$message_0137_0017_0002$$$::Shirou, are you ready to assume control of Saber?"::
18122::$$$message_0137_0018_0000$$$::"...I have no idea if I should say yes or no, but give us the rundown."::
18123::$$$message_0137_0019_0000$$$::"Hm! Well met, my elite soldiers![lr]::
18124::$$$message_0137_0019_0001$$$::You must now brave numerous trials and breach that redoubt of evil, Illya's Castle![lr]::
18125::$$$message_0137_0019_0002$$$::There, you will defeat Lord Loli Gym Shorts, and take the castle for ourselves! I think it's high time [font italic=true]I[font italic=false] get to rule as a princess!"::
18126::$$$message_0137_0020_0000$$$::Thunder roars.[lr]::
18127::$$$message_0137_0020_0001$$$::...She's ignoring everything I say, but I get what she wants us to do.::
18128::$$$message_0137_0021_0000$$$::"So basically, we can't get to the Einzbern Castle until we beat a bunch of minigames?"[lr]::
18129::$$$message_0137_0021_0001$$$::"Precisely. Beyond this point lies a demonic realm governed by the absurd. But I know you've got what it takes to pull through![whitestar]"::
18130::$$$message_0137_0022_0000$$$::"As you wish! 'Tis time to dispense with mercy; I will strike down all rivals ahead of me with this sacred sword![lr]::
18131::$$$message_0137_0022_0001$$$::I expect you have no objections to that, Shirou."::
18132::$$$message_0137_0023_0000$$$::Saber's ready to make heads roll.[lr]::
18133::$$$message_0137_0023_0001$$$::Her biggest flaw is that she refuses to finish in anything but first place in a competition.::
18134::$$$message_0137_0024_0000$$$::"That's right. Consider every other team your enemy.[lr]::
18135::$$$message_0137_0024_0001$$$::This course consists of three stages.[lr]::
18136::$$$message_0137_0024_0002$$$::Shirou and Saber, form a team and overcome all challenges."::
18137::$$$message_0137_0025_0000$$$::"All right, let's get started![lr]::
18138::$$$message_0137_0025_0001$$$::This is a holy war to conquer the evil fort in the woods[line len=2]a lovey-dovey game between you and me![lr]::
18139::$$$message_0137_0025_0002$$$::I call it...!"::
918118::$$$message_9137_0016_0000$$$::"Hehehe. You're eager to see blood tonight."[r]:)&j